  "description": "Roslyn analyzers for Kanject Core realtime (proposal 0067): a constant passed as a topic kind or a message type is checked at build against the grammar Kanject.Core.Realtime applies when the call runs. Reports KANRT250 (topic kind), KANRT251 (message type) and KANRT252 (a message type under Core's own realtime. prefix), and refuses to check nothing: KANRT253 for a marker on a parameter no constant can reach, KANRT254 for a Kanject.Core.Realtime.Abstractions that carries no markers. A value that isn't a constant is left to the runtime check.",
